WEBVTT

00:13:29.348 --> 00:13:31.708
(in Sanskrit).

00:13:31.708 --> 00:13:34.481
That means "ever-smiling speaker

00:13:34.481 --> 00:13:39.000
of beautiful languages."

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:40.964
Language is beautiful.

00:13:40.964 --> 00:13:43.418
I think it's the most beautiful of human creations.

00:13:43.418 --> 00:13:47.396
I think it's the loveliest thing
that our brains have invented.

00:13:47.396 --> 00:13:50.980
It entertains, it educates, it enlightens,

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:53.024
but what I like the most about language

00:13:53.024 --> 00:13:54.524
is that it empowers.

00:13:54.524 --> 00:13:56.362
I want to leave you with this.

00:13:56.362 --> 00:13:58.747
This is a photograph of my collaborators,

00:13:58.747 --> 00:13:59.744
my earliest collaborators

00:13:59.744 --> 00:14:01.206
when I started working on language